### Fichier de tests manuels de l'API JOBSINC (Jeton VS Code / REST Client)
### Serveur : npm run dev dans backend/ — base http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Inscription candidat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register/candidate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phone": "+221770000111",
  "country": "Sénégal",
  "city": "Dakar",
  "birthDate": "1996-01-01"
}

### 2. Inscription entreprise
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "E2E",
  "lastName": "Recruiter",
  "email": "recruteur@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "companyName": "JOBSINC Corp"
}

### 3. Connexion entreprise
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recruteur@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Session courante /me (remplacer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI par le token du login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 5. Profil entreprise (authentifié)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/company/profile
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 6. Création d'une offre d'emploi
POST http://localhost:5000/api/company/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

{
  "title": "Développeur Full-Stack",
  "description": "Poste de développeur TypeScript / Node.js / React.",
  "location": "Dakar",
  "contractType": "CDI",
  "workMode": "Sur site",
  "experience": "2 à 5 ans",
  "skills": "JavaScript\nReact\nNode.js",
  "educationLevel": "Licence",
  "minExperienceYears": 0,
  "maxExperienceYears": 3
}

### 7. Dashboard entreprise
GET http://localhost:5000/api/company/dashboard?days=30
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 8. Candidatures entreprise (avec scores de matching)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/company/applications
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 9. Recommandations matching (décroissant)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/company/matching?minScore=0
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 10. Liste des conversations recruteur (legacy)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/company/messages
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 11. Liste des conversations candidat (unifié)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### 12. Offres publiques
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs

### 13. Entreprises publiques
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies

### 14. FAQ publique
GET http://localhost:5000/api/faq/public

### 15. Feedback public
GET http://localhost:5000/api/feedback/public